---
layout: base.njk
title: 태그
description: Winter Wanderer의 글 태그.
navSection: tags
---
<main id="main" class="page collection-page">
  <div class="collection-heading"><p class="eyebrow">BROWSE</p><h1>태그</h1><p>글에 붙인 키워드를 모아둘 공간입니다.</p></div>
  <section class="collection-panel{% if collections.postTags.length %} category-panel{% endif %}" aria-label="태그 목록">
    {% for tag in collections.postTags %}<a href="/tags/{{ tag.slug }}/"><span>{{ tag.name }}</span><span>{{ tag.posts.length }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>{% else %}<p>아직 태그가 없습니다.</p>{% endfor %}
  </section>
</main>
